## Dashboard & Comment Checklist (remind tester for every test)

After each PR is raised:

```
[ ] Wait 30-60 seconds
[ ] Open http://localhost:8010/dashboard — refresh it
[ ] Confirm PR shows status = "completed" (not "ignored")
[ ] Check risk score and level shown
[ ] Open the PR on GitHub/GitLab
[ ] Check PR comments tab for merge readiness comment
[ ] Check Files Changed tab for inline review comments
[ ] Compare to expected result
[ ] Mark PASS or FAIL
```

---

## Common Problems and Fixes

| Symptom | Fix |
|---|---|
| Status stays "ignored" | Wrong webhook event type — re-open or push a new commit to the PR |
| No inline comments appear | Check `POST_COMMENTS_ENABLED=true` in `.env` and restart the server |
| Risk score always 15 | That is correct for a small clean PR — not a bug |
| Dashboard shows 3 rows for 1 PR | Pull latest code — this was fixed in the dashboard dedup patch |
| Ollama misses duplicate code | Switch to `LLM_PROVIDER=gemini` in `.env` |
| Comments appear but no inline code comments | GitHub token needs `pull_requests:write` scope |
| Server not responding | Run `uvicorn app.main:app --reload --port 8010` from the `pr-agent/` directory |

