## After testing is complete

Ask the tester: "Would you like me to log your test results?"

If yes, write a test report to `test-results/YYYY-MM-DD-results.md` with:
- Date and tester name
- Each scenario: PASS / FAIL / SKIPPED
- Any unexpected behaviour observed
- Environment used (Gemini / Ollama / both)
